stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Planned
  Planned --> Prepared: Create new key and signed migration plan
  Prepared --> DualRead: Enable explicitly allowed old/new readers
  DualRead --> Rewrapping: New writes use new version
  Rewrapping --> Verifying: Idempotent per-capsule CAS updates
  Rewrapping --> Paused: Fault or dependency outage
  Paused --> Rewrapping: Resume from trusted journal
  Verifying --> Cutover: Counts and decrypt checks match
  Verifying --> Paused: Verification fails
  Cutover --> Retired: Reject retired versions in online path
  Retired --> DestroyEligible: Backup retention and recovery checks complete
  DestroyEligible --> [*]: Destroy allowed copies and record limits
